Package: homelab-borg-service-backup-server
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.10), python3-yaml, borgbackup, adduser, openssh-server
Conflicts: borgbackup2
Description: Homelab service/config backup server built on borg
 Centralized-server counterpart to homelab-borg-service-backup-client.
 Installing this package creates the borgbackup system user/group and
 backup directory, and provides
 `homelab-borg-service-backup-server enroll <identifier> <pubkey>` to
 grant a client host access to its own repository, restricted via a
 forced `borg serve --restrict-to-repository` SSH command -- client
 hosts never need SSH or sudo access to this server to onboard.
